{"id":15242,"author":"Cyclops","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eWelcome to the details/info page on Match #27 (UHC Reboot: Slave Market/Kill The Leader).\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eMatch will be held tomorrow, July 24th, 3pm Eastern Standard Time.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eWhitelist will be turned off 45 minutes prior to start.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eKill the Leader: \u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003eEach team will have a leader. If the leader dies, the whole team dies :D (Leaders get potion effect advantage).\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eSlave Market:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003ePre-game, there will be an X amount of players to be slave owners.randomly chosen. These players get 20 diamonds to bid on the \"Slaves\" (left-over players). Any remaining diamonds kept could be used in the match, so you can have a ten-man team, or go solo with 20 diamonds.\u003cbr\u003e(For this game, every slave owner will have a starter teammate at random).\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eServer Info:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\" title=\"Link: https://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\" style=\"color: rgb(3, 141, 210); text-decoration: none; font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003ehttps://avicus.net/forums/6aaf332fa\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eCya ya'll there, happy killing.|\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cu\u003eNamed the server to Evolve :D\u003c/u\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-